# NEW GEN BLACKLIST V3 - SOURCE list
#
# THIS is the only file you edit. Edit it right here in GitHub's web editor.
# The published list the world downloads is generated from it.
#
# TO ADD SOMEONE: paste their profile link on its own line under [blacklist].
#   https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx | why, and the date
# Commit, wait about a minute, and the bot rewrites your line to add their
# display name, which it reads off their public profile page. No login needed.
#
# ALWAYS PASTE THE LINK, NOT JUST A NAME. The usr_ id is the only thing that
# survives a rename. The bot re-reads every id every 6 hours, so someone who
# renames to dodge the list gets put back on it by themselves. A name-only line
# is a line they escape by changing their name.
#
# TO REMOVE SOMEONE: delete their line.

